1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,060
Good afternoon. My name's Mrs Carter and I run the before

2
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:09,590
and after school extended hours childcare service.

3
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:12,680
I hope you've had a chance to have a good look around the school

4
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:15,200
and talk to staff and pupils.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,880
I know that many of you are interested in using our childcare service

6
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:21,683
when your child joins the school,

7
00:00:21,683 --> 00:00:24,413
and perhaps you already know something about it,

8
00:00:24,413 --> 00:00:29,190
but for those that don't, I'll go through the main details now.

9
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:36,930
We offer childcare for children from the ages of four to eleven both before and after school.

10
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:41,680
I know that many parents who work find this service invaluable.

11
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:48,220
You can leave your child with us safe in the knowledge that they will be extremely well cared for.

12
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:52,760
We are insured to provide care for up to 70 children,

13
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:57,300
although we rarely have this many attending at any one session.

14
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:03,315
I think we generally expect around 50-60 children for the afternoon sessions

15
00:01:03,315 --> 00:01:07,480
and about half that number for the breakfast sessions.

16
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:12,600
Although we currently do have 70 children registered with us

17
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:15,060
not all of these attend every day.

18
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:20,040
It's ten years since we began offering an extended hours service

19
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:22,900
and we've come a long way during that time.

20
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:27,610
When we first opened, we only had about 20 children attending regularly.

21
00:01:27,610 --> 00:01:31,780
We try to keep our costs as low as we can

22
00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:35,300
and we think we provide very good value for money.

23
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:42,350
For the afternoon sessions, which run from 3.30 until 6 p. m., it's £7.20.

24
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:47,720
But if you prefer, you can pay for one hour only, which costs £3

25
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:52,290
50, or two hours which costs £5.70.

26
00:01:52,290 --> 00:01:56,920
The cost of the childcare includes food and snacks.

27
00:01:56,920 --> 00:02:00,620
They'll be given breakfast in the morning and in the afternoon

28
00:02:00,620 --> 00:02:04,500
a healthy snack as soon as they finish school.

29
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:08,340
At 5 p. m. children are given something more substantial

30
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:11,430
such as pasta or a casserole.

31
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:15,715
Please inform us of any allergies that your child might have

32
00:02:15,715 --> 00:02:20,000
and we'll make sure they're offered a suitable alternative.

33
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:27,500
As you may know, the childcare service runs through the school holidays from 8 a. m. to 6 p. m.

34
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:31,742
We offer a really varied and exciting programme to keep the children entertained -

35
00:02:31,742 --> 00:02:36,310
we don't want them to feel as if they are still at school!

36
00:02:36,310 --> 00:02:41,710
It will also feel different because they'll get the chance to make new friends

37
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:45,310
with children from other schools - spaces are available for them

38
00:02:45,310 --> 00:02:50,350
because a lot of our term-time children don't always attend during the holiday.

39
00:02:50,350 --> 00:02:52,940
In the past, parents have asked

40
00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:57,854
if children over the age of 11 are allowed to come with their younger brothers

41
00:02:57,854 --> 00:03:01,320
and sisters - but I'm afraid we're unable to do this

42
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:05,000
because of the type of insurance we have.

43
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:12,750
So now let me tell you about some of the activities that your child can do during the afterschool sessions.

44
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:16,611
As well as being able to use the playground equipment,

45
00:03:16,611 --> 00:03:23,560
computers and the library, there is usually at least one 'special' activity that children can do each day.

46
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,930
For example, Spanish.

47
00:03:25,930 --> 00:03:33,770
We have a specialist teacher coming in every Thursday to give a basic introduction to the language through games and songs.

48
00:03:33,770 --> 00:03:39,540
She does two sessions: one for the over 8s and one for the younger children.

49
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:44,620
This is the only activity which we have to make an extra charge for

50
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:46,460
but it's well worth it.

51
00:03:46,460 --> 00:03:51,050
Once a week the children have the opportunity to do some music.

52
00:03:51,050 --> 00:03:55,690
We're very lucky that one of our staff is a member of a folk band.

53
00:03:55,690 --> 00:04:00,970
On Mondays, she teaches singing and percussion to groups of children.

54
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:06,955
We do rely on parental support for this, so if any of you sing or play an instrument

55
00:04:06,955 --> 00:04:11,610
and would be prepared to help out at these sessions, we'd be delighted.

56
00:04:11,610 --> 00:04:16,780
Painting continues to be one of the most popular activities.

57
00:04:16,780 --> 00:04:22,455
To begin with we weren't keen on offering this because of the extra mess involved,

58
00:04:22,455 --> 00:04:28,130
but children kept asking if they could do some art and so we finally gave in.

59
00:04:28,130 --> 00:04:34,130
Art is great for helping the children to relax after working hard at school all day.

60
00:04:34,130 --> 00:04:38,402
Yoga is something that we've been meaning to introduce for some time

61
00:04:38,402 --> 00:04:43,660
but haven't been able to find anyone available to teach it - until now that is.

62
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:45,840
So we'll see how this goes.

63
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:51,030
Hopefully, children will benefit in all sorts of ways from this.

64
00:04:51,030 --> 00:04:54,020
Cooking is another popular activity.

65
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:58,680
They make a different sort of cake, or pizza or bread each week.

66
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:01,140
Although the younger children love doing it

67
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:04,872
we found that the mess was just too much,

68
00:05:04,872 --> 00:05:08,060
so we've decided to restrict this to the over 8s

69
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:13,000
as they are better able to clean up after themselves.
